    "text": {
     "en": "An empire is a large area with many peoples ruled by one ruler. Empires rise through strong armies, good administration, fertile land, trade, iron weapons and capable leaders.\nMagadha rose because of the fertile Ganga plain, iron mines nearby, rivers for transport and rulers like Bimbisara and Ajatashatru.\nEmpires left roads, coins, laws, art and ideas, a legacy we still see."
    }
